up on some personal stuff.

00:04:27.967 --> 00:04:30.336
You know, I check my inbox,
I returns some emails,

00:04:30.336 --> 00:04:32.271
and of course,
I send out thank you notes.

00:04:32.271 --> 00:04:34.173
And I was running --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:34.173 --> 00:04:36.041
