00:04:36.041 --> 00:04:37.477
so I thought if you guys
wouldn't mind,

00:04:37.477 --> 00:04:39.111
I'd like to write out my weekly
thank you notes right now.

00:04:39.111 --> 00:04:40.112
Is that okay with you?

00:04:40.112 --> 00:04:41.881
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:41.881 --> 00:04:43.049
Appreciate it.
James, can I get some

00:04:43.049 --> 00:04:44.817
thank you note
writing music, please?

00:04:44.817 --> 00:04:46.552
-Oh, there you go.

00:04:46.552 --> 00:04:48.521
[ Laughter ]

00:04:48.521 --> 00:04:51.523
Oh
-Oh.

00:04:51.523 --> 00:04:52.692
It's like dog head.

00:04:52.692 --> 00:04:54.694 line:0%
♪♪

00:04:54.694 --> 00:04:57.630
-Thank you,
Ron DeSantis' ongoing feud

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:00.299
